          "explanation": "The tunnel, a relic of the Unmentionable Times, matters because it is the first private space Equality has ever had -- somewhere to experiment, study stolen manuscripts, and write his forbidden diary. It does not lead him out of the city; his escape comes much later and by other means. He meets Liberty 5-3000 in the fields, not underground.",
