          "explanation": "Light is humanity's oldest image for knowledge and reason, so the glowing wire makes Rand's argument visible: progress is the product of a mind. It also shows how far this society has fallen -- the Unmentionable Times had such lights, and now candles are the pinnacle. Electric light was not new in 1937 (Edison's team demonstrated a practical bulb in 1879), which is exactly why its loss is so striking.",
