            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">WE vs ANTHEM</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"23\">Shared parts, opposite endings</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"170\" width=\"460\" height=\"420\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(59,130,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"290\" y=\"225\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">WE (1924)</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"290\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">D-503, I-330</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"340\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Green Wall</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"390\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">High tech: a spaceship</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"440\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Ends: the Great Operation</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"520\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">DEFEAT</text><rect x=\"580\" y=\"170\" width=\"460\" height=\"420\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"810\" y=\"225\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">ANTHEM (1938)</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"290\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Equality, Liberty</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"340\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Uncharted Forest</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"390\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Low tech: candles</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"440\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Ends: the word I</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"520\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">TRIUMPH</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"680\" width=\"700\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"740\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"22\">Journal form in both books</text></svg>",
            "caption": "Parallel parts, divergent visions"
