          "explanation": "Both books are told as a narrator's secret journal, both give citizens number-names, and both separate the city from free nature -- Zamyatin's Green Wall, Rand's Uncharted Forest. The differences are just as sharp: We's One State is high-tech while Anthem's world uses candles, and We ends in defeat while Anthem ends in triumph. We was banned in the USSR and first appeared in English in 1924; Anthem first appeared in Britain in 1938.",
