          "explanation": "The other three end in defeat: D-503 is operated on, John the Savage is destroyed, and Winston is broken into loving Big Brother. Anthem alone ends in triumph, with the hero discovering the word I and planning a new society. Numbered citizens and forbidden love appear across the tradition. And Anthem was written in 1937 and first published in 1938, before the war, while Orwell's novel came in 1949.",
